' Isolated Trace Cycle dest. F6 and TRACE CYCLE share this controller.
' Play and campaign saves stay on version 1. Far lift, vault and return chase
' are dest-only until campaign version 2.
' October 25: first-person ride, dual dashboard, honest crashes, link sockets.
